WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
but on an even much bigger scale, much, much bigger.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.760
Very sad to see whether the U.N.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.120
can manage to play a productive role.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.520
I've come here today to offer the hand of American leadership

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.400
and friendship to any nation in this assembly

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.040
that is willing to join us in forging a safer.

